      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-02-15_WidnesExaminer_art0074" n="art0074">
        <head>VALUABLE PRESCRIPTION. For Diseases of the os NERVES, STOMACH AND KIDNEYS. Costs a Few Pence.</head>
        <p>A VALUABLE PRESCRIPTION. For Diseases of the os NERVES, STOMACH AND KIDNEYS. Costs a Few Pence.</p>
        <p>For nerve and bodily weakness in children or adults arising from any cause, and for such complaints as weak kidneys, palpitation, loss of appetite, anomie, indigestion, nervous hysteria, spinal and nerve paralysis, and general physical debility, a simple yet perfectly harmless and invaluable remedy is Dr. Cassell's Tablets. These Tablets build flesh, nerve force, and bodily strength in a manner that surprises everyone who takes them. The prescription from which they are made is a very famous one, and the suffering public are to be congratulated on the fact that they can now obtain the remedy ready for use in boxes at 101 d., from any chemist. Ask for Dr. Cassell's Tablets.</p>
