        <p>COUNTY COUNCIL OF LANCASHIRE. TENDERS FOR STATIONERY, &amp;c.—The Finance 1 Committee of the County Council of Lancashire invite TENDERS for the SUPPLY of the STATIONERY, &amp;c., reqnired at the County Offices, Preston, from Ist April, 1908, to 31st March, 1909. Forms of Tender and Specifications and all information may be obtained, and samples seen, on application to the Stationery Clerk, County Offices, Preston, on or after 17th February. Sealed tenders, endorsed" Tenders for Stationery," and addressed to the Chairman of the Finance Committee, must be delivered at the County Offices, Preston, not later than Saturday, the 29th day of February, 1908. The Committee do neLpind themselves to accept the lowest or any tender. HARCOURT E. CLARE, Clerk to the County Council. County Offices, Preston, February 14th, 1908.</p>
